{{field-1}} $i$\n$-$\n{{field-2}} $j$\n$+$\n{{field-3}} $k$" :question/worked-solution "To compute the product, we multiply each component individually:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a & =3\\cdot (4i-2j) \\\\  & =3\\cdot (4i-2j+0k) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 4i+3\\cdot (-2j)+3\\cdot 0k \\\\  & =12\\,i-6\\,j+0\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186242656 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b41a801d-eba6-5deb-8e5e-375f398b85b0" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Sums and Scalar Multiplication of Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e074ecde-8b32-544b-9e7b-4131d62b9185" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242658} {:answer/id #uuid "d7472690-59cf-56f7-8bdb-19853b706873" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242659}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e074ecde-8b32-544b-9e7b-4131d62b9185" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242658} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb8149b9-ef39-5e25-8d07-0e8d0bcc3fc6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242657} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3848aef2-e376-510b-ad26-166feaf9bbc6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242661}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3848aef2-e376-510b-ad26-166feaf9bbc6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242661} :answer-field/id #uuid "6db189fa-489d-5638-99e5-9da26e086a94" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242660} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24ab689d-2239-5316-bb28-06dea367dc15" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242663}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24ab689d-2239-5316-bb28